==Norwegian Bokmål==

===Etymology===
It is believed that the first part of the name (''Ski-'') comes from ''[[skagi]]'', Old Norse meaning "raised object", while the last part comes from the word ''[[þveit]]'', a common [[Viking]] age farm name.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nb|/ʃɪptʋɛt/}}
* {{rhymes|nb|ɛt}}

